# Monorepo map

- **ERP admin UI:** `apps/admin-panel` (`@jkbalaji/admin-panel`, port 3002). Not inside `real-estate-web`.
- **Real estate public site:** `apps/real-estate-web` (port 3000).
- **Jewellery public site:** `apps/jewellery-web` (port 3001).
- **API:** `backend/api` (`@jkbalaji/api`, port 4000). Nest modules under `backend/api/src/modules/`.
- **Billing / invoices:** API `backend/api/src/modules/billing/`; admin billing under `apps/admin-panel`.
- **DB:** Prisma in `database/`; generate via `npm run db:generate`.
- **Deploy:** `deployment/deploy.ps1`, `BUILD_TARGETS` (default ERP deploy: `admin,api`).

Before broad searches, open the app or module above for the user’s task. See `docs/LIVE-ARCHITECTURE.md`.
